TY  - JOUR
TI  - Effective Human-AI Teams via Learned Natural Language Rules and Onboarding
AU  - Hussein Mozannar
AU  - Jimin Lee
AU  - Dennis Wei
AU  - Prasanna Sattigeri
AU  - Subhro Das
AU  - David Sontag
PY  - 2023
AB  - People are relying on AI agents to assist them with various tasks. The human must know when to rely on the agent, collaborate with the agent, or ignore its suggestions. In this work, we propose to learn rules grounded in data regions and described in natural language that illustrate how the human should collaborate with the AI. Our novel region discovery algorithm finds local regions in the data as neighborhoods in an embedding space that corrects the human prior. Each region is then described using an iterative and contrastive procedure where a large language model describes the region. We then teach these rules to the human via an onboarding stage. Through user studies on object detection and question-answering tasks, we show that our method can lead to more accurate human-AI teams. We also evaluate our region discovery and description algorithms separately.
UR  - https://papers.nips.cc/paper_files/paper/2023/hash/61355b9c218505505d1bedede9da56b2-Abstract-Conference.html
